{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:607700262e6b5619","name":"Sith Spy","source":{"id":"source:reference-607700262e6b5619","title":"Sith Spy","revision":20308,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:36:30Z","sha256":"e8ca51b2b67d8d2cd798a514aafce3f842da95135ba480548928baf0b0028266","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20308","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Spy&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-607700262e6b5619","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lackeys of the Sith Lords, Sith Spies are hidden observers spread throughout the Empire and beyond. Every Sith Spy answers to a single Sith Lord (few spies are bold enough to act as double agents for two Sith), and Sith Spies are most common on worlds where anti-Imperial sentiments or Alliance sympathies threaten to undermine the authority of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," (such as on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothawui"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothawui","referenceId":"reference:75082da1d3f8a127"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dorin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dorin","referenceId":"reference:4331a79784e79b6d"},"). Not every Sith Spy is in a position to uncover major secrets just by virtue of his or her occupation or lifestyle; Sith Spies are just as likely to be ordinary citizens as they are to be high ranking officers in the Imperial Navy or corporate agents in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sith Spies prize, above all, their secrecy. A Sith Spy will almost never reveal his or her affiliation, because to do so would mean certain death. Sith Spies reap handsome rewards for their service, but only those who enjoy wealthy or prestigious positions have the ability to flaunt it. Most Sith Spies serve their masters because of greed, though others might have different motives. A Sith Spy might have a vendetta against one of their master's rivals, while another might simply believe that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," are good for the Empire.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sith Spy Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +6; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, 1 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 13 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","